# Personal data safety + Run Everything

Run Everything is enabled so the agent can manage local dev servers (ports, pnpm, curl localhost, LAN) without sandbox blocks.

Never do anything destructive to personal data outside the active project workspace. Do not delete, move, overwrite, or mass-edit files under home directories, credentials, photos, mail, browser profiles, Documents/Downloads, or other personal paths. Confine file and process changes to the current repo and its normal local ports unless the user explicitly asks otherwise.
